s8fti xh1vicy xcp7ckg xzfsp05 x1rzuvji xuk3077 focusable-list-item x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div data-testid="msg-container" class="x1liijdw xu342n7 xelbjmh x16pgt24 x14ug900 x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xdl72j9 x12lqup9 x17fgdl5 x1n2onr6 x1qg1ob xxx6ivz x1gx27l9 x14fraq8 x2nxwck xb3dwbw"><div class="x1liijdw xu342n7 xelbjmh x16pgt24 x1n2onr6 x12xzxwr x1g5lz36 xgdw1sx false false"><div><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xodvfiu xct3hqd xwib8y2"><div class="copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[20:48, 15/08/2026] Khushi Singh: "><div class="x1198e8h x1lxpwgx xzueoph xw01apr"><div></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1mzt3pk x126k92a x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="x1lliihq"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="🤖" draggable="false" data-testid="selectable-text" class="b96 emoji wa  xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-plain-text="🤖" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px -60px;"> Task 2 Complete: California Housing — Model Comparison &amp; Optimization
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">Following up on my last post about building a baseline Linear Regression model — here's how I took it further as part of the Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning Internship at Maincrafts Technology!
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">In Task 1, I built a single model. Task 2 pushed me to think like an ML engineer actually does in real-world projects — preparing data properly, testing multiple algorithms, and choosing the best one based on evidence, not guesswork.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="🔍" draggable="false" data-testid="selectable-text" class="b76 emoji wa  xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-plain-text="🔍" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -20px -20px;"> What I did:
</span><span class="x1lliihq"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="✅" draggable="false" data-testid="selectable-text" class="b6 emoji wa  xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-plain-text="✅" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px 0px;"> Applied Feature Scaling (StandardScaler) to bring all features to a common scale
</span><span class="x1lliihq"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="✅" draggable="false" data-testid="selectable-text" class="b6 emoji wa  xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-plain-text="✅" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px 0px;"> Trained and compared 3 regression models: Linear Regression, Ridge Regression, and Decision Tree
</span><span class="x1lliihq"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="✅" draggable="false" data-testid="selectable-text" class="b6 emoji wa  xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-plain-text="✅" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px 0px;"> Evaluated each model using RMSE and R² Score
</span><span class=""><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="✅" draggable="false" data-testid="selectable-text" class="b6 emoji wa  xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-plain-text="✅" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px 0px;"> Selecte…</span></span> <div role="button" tabindex="0" data-testid="caption-read-more-button" class="xuxw1ft x1ypdohk x1rg5ohu xo1mcw5 x1xlr1w8 x1hl2dhg xt0b8zv xbvygy2 x17f7hit xp30eni xhmieyt read-more-button" fdprocessedid="ml081a">Read more</div><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xn6xy2s"></span><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">20:48</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk" data-testid="msg-meta" role="button"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">20:48</span></span><div class="xhslqc4 x1rg5ohu x7phf20"><span aria-hidden="false" aria-label=" Read " class="x1rv0e52"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="currentColor"><title>wds-ic-read</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.73 6.01a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15l.01.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41L7.6 18.01a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05c-.26 0-.52-.11-.71-.3l-4.03-4.09a.99.99 0 0 1 0-1.41.99.99 0 0 1 1.41 0l3.25 3.29 7.99-9.86Zm5.71.12a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15h-.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41l-8.41 10.45a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05a1 1 0 0 1-.71-.3l-1.36-1.26a.55.55 0 0 1-.02-.81l.56-.68c.21-.2.53-.21.75-.03l.71.58 7.71-9.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><span class=""></span><div class="x10l6tqk xyc4j8s xceh6e4"></div></div></div><div c